  "description": "Adele, a girl born in an orphanage and raised by her uncle, finds an egg in the forest. Little did she know, she has adopted herself a .charming dragon prince! After nine years of living under her wicked aunt and cousins who forced her into doing all the house chores, Adele's lifes turns upside down through the little boy that hatches out of a giant egg. Adele names the boy Zigmunt and takes care of him with love and care. Meanwhile, the Grand Duke Hernes and the Grand Wizard Jensen are in a desperate search for the lost dragon egg, from which the new emperor of the Bysen Empire. Adele's life turns upside down as she enters the Royal Palace with Zigmunt. That is only the beginning of this very special love story, one between the blood-thirsty dragon prince Zigmunt and his Adele.\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)",
